 "lookaside_slot_evidence": {
  "how": "la_alloc() (la_common.h) records for every block a control takes: address in [db->lookaside.pStart, pEnd); offset from pStart a multiple of lookaside.sz; the lookaside hit counter anStat[0] up by exactly 1 across the sqlite3DbMallocRaw call; sqlite3DbMallocSize(db, p) == lookaside.sz. CHECK <name>-is-lookaside-slot is ok only if all four hold. On the protected arm the block's capability bounds are also exactly the slot, [p, p+1200), as lookasideIssue derives them.",
  "positive_control": {
   "program": "controls/lookaside/slot-check-negative/control.c, run by slot-check-negative.py (one boot per arm, same platform, compiled with the exact command recorded for la-control-parent); not part of the pre-registered set",
   "expected": {
    "small (128 B, lookaside on)": "ok",
    "oversize (2000 B > sz)": "FAILED",
    "disabled (128 B, bDisable++)": "FAILED"
   },
   "held": true,
   "arms": {
